  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGOCC Institutional Assessment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NGOCC Institutional Assessment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden bed&#xf6;mer m&#xf6;jligheten att ge k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till NGOCC. Trots att NGOCC har genomf&#xf6;rt egna bed&#xf6;mningar och delat dessa med ambassaden s&#xe5; kr&#xe4;vs det en oberoende bed&#xf6;mning f&#xf6;r att ta st&#xe4;llning till huruvida NGOCC har system och rutiner samt kapacitet f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla tillr&#xe4;cklig intern styrning och kontroll. Ambassaden kommer att ta med vissa av de identifierade riskerna som del av avtalsvillkoren med NGOCC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy is assessing the possibility of providing core support to NGOCC. While NGOCC has been subjected to various self assessments and shared these with the Embassy, an independent institutional assessment is required to look into the management and internal controls of the organisation in order to inform the Embassy&apos;s review. Addressing of weaknesses identified will form part of the agreement with NGOCC.</narrative>
  </description>
